---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with the Chinese Mountains team — corrections, suggestions, and mountain stories welcome.">
<section class="pt-12 pb-20">
<div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6" style="max-width:48rem">
<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900">Contact Us</h1>
<p class="mt-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">Have a question, a correction, or a mountain story of your own? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-4">What to Reach Out About</h2>
<ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-600">
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Corrections:</strong> Spotted an outdated ticket price, a wrong elevation, or a trail that's now closed? Tell us and we'll fix it.</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Mountain suggestions:</strong> Is there a peak we're missing that deserves a page? Let us know — especially if you've been there yourself.</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Contributions:</strong> If you're a photographer or writer with original Chinese mountain content, we're open to featuring it with full credit.</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Press and partnerships:</strong> Media inquiries, collaboration ideas, or academic requests are all welcome.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-4">Email</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The best way to reach us is by email at <a href="mailto:hello@chinese-mountains.com" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">hello@chinese-mountains.com</a>. We aim to respond within 2-3 business days.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-4">Response Times</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">We read every message, but as a small independent team we may not be able to reply to every one. Corrections and factual errors get priority. If you're reporting a broken feature or bug, including a screenshot helps enormously.</p>
</div>
</section>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Chinese Mountains",
    "url": "https://www.chinese-mountains.com",
    "contactPoint": {
      "@type": "ContactPoint",
      "email": "hello@chinese-mountains.com",
      "contactType": "customer support",
      "url": "https://www.chinese-mountains.com/contact"
    }
  })} />
</BaseLayout>
